<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine Shell unit to export asphalt.</title>
<headline>Philippine Shell unit to export asphalt.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine oil refiner Pilipinas Shell Petroleum Corp, a unit of Royal Dutch Shell Group of Companies, said on Friday it would export most of the output from its newly upgraded asphalt plant.</p>
<p>Pilipinas Shell said 75 percent of the plant's 210,000 tonnes annual production will be exported to Vietnam, Bangladesh, Cambodia, Myanmar and China.</p>
<p>The rest of the output from the plant will be sold locally. The Philippines' annual demand for asphalt is around 90,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>Before the expansion, the plant produced 70,000 tonnes of asphalt annually.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 fax 8176267</p>
